" end="02:04.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24"><span begin="02:01.866" end="02:02.759">奪わ</span><span begin="02:02.759" end="02:03.455">れる</span><span begin="02:03.455" end="02:04.080">こと</span></p><p begin="02:04.421" end="02:06.655" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25"><span begin="02:04.421" end="02:04.723">で</span><span begin="02:04.723" end="02:05.045">も</span><span begin="02:05.045" end="02:05.979">気付く</span><span begin="02:05.979" end="02:06.655">こと</span></p><p begin="02:06.960" end="02:09.189" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26"><span begin="02:06.960" end="02:07.586">君</span><span begin="02:07.586" end="02:07.909">が</span><span begin="02:07.909" end="02:08.580">いる</span><span begin="02:08.580" end="02:09.189">こと</span></p><p begin="02:09.509" end="02:11.767" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27"><span begin="02:09.509" end="02:10.122">守り</span><span begin="02:10.122" end="02:10.789">たい</span><span begin="02:10.789" end="02:11.395">もの</span><span begin="02:11.395" end="02:11.767">が</span></p><p begin="02:12.053" end="02:15.261" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="02:12.053" end="02:12.677">強く</span><span begin="02:12.677" end="02:12.995">さ</span><span begin="02:12.995" end="02:13.636">せる</span><span begin="02:13.636" end="02:15.261">こと</span></p></div><div begin="02:17.094" end="02:38.488" itunes:song-part="Chorus"><p begin="02:17.094" end="02:21.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="02:17.094" end="02:18.076">自分</span><span begin="02:18.076" end="02:18.422">の</span><span begin="02:18.745" end="02:19.119">色</span><span begin="02:19.119" end="02:19.743">を</span><span begin="02:19.743" end="02:20.938">誇れる</span><span begin="02:20.938" end="02:21.605">よう</span><span begin="02:21.605" end="02:21.935">に</span></p><p begin="02:22.294" end="02:27.106" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="02:22.294" end="02:23.257">自由</span><span begin="02:23.257" end="02:23.537">に</span><span begin="02:23.847" end="02:24.223">色</span><span begin="02:24.223" end="0